#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using Yii with FrankenPHP"
msgstr "Usando o Yii com FrankenPHP"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[FrankenPHP](https://frankenphp.dev/) is an application server for PHP with Caddy built in. It can run Yii in \n"
"[worker mode](using-with-event-loop.md), allowing the framework bootstrap to happen once per worker instead of\n"
"once per request.\n"
msgstr ""
"O [FrankenPHP](https://frankenphp.dev/) é um servidor de aplicação PHP com o Caddy embutido. Ele pode rodar o Yii em\n"
"[modo worker](using-with-event-loop.md), o que faz o bootstrap do framework acontecer uma vez por worker em vez de\n"
"uma vez por requisição.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "The [FrankenPHP runner](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-runner-frankenphp) requires PHP 8.1–8.5.  Install FrankenPHP using its [installation instructions](https://frankenphp.dev/docs/), or use the Docker setup in the Yii application templates described below."
msgstr "O [runner para FrankenPHP](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-runner-frankenphp) exige PHP 8.1–8.5.  Instale o FrankenPHP seguindo as [instruções de instalação](https://frankenphp.dev/docs/) dele, ou use a configuração Docker dos templates de aplicação do Yii, descrita abaixo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "Install the runner package with Composer:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote do runner com o Composer:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer require yiisoft/yii-runner-frankenphp\n"
msgstr "composer require yiisoft/yii-runner-frankenphp\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "FrankenPHP works especially well in containerized deployments and is the runtime used by the Yii application templates Docker setup described in [Docker in application templates](docker.md)."
msgstr "O FrankenPHP funciona especialmente bem em deploys com containers e é o runtime usado pela configuração Docker dos templates de aplicação do Yii, descrita em [Docker nos templates de aplicação](docker.md)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> This runner is for worker mode. To use FrankenPHP in classic mode, keep `public/index.php` and\n"
"> [yiisoft/yii-runner-http](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-runner-http), the default HTTP runner in the templates.\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> Este runner é para o modo worker. Para usar o FrankenPHP no modo clássico, mantenha o `public/index.php` e o\n"
"> [yiisoft/yii-runner-http](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-runner-http), o runner HTTP padrão dos templates.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "First, configure the worker entry script."
msgstr "Primeiro, configure o script de entrada do worker."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-rapira.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Worker entry script"
msgstr "Script de entrada do worker"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "Create `/worker.php` in the project root:"
msgstr "Crie `/worker.php` na raiz do projeto:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Environment;\n"
"use Psr\\Log\\LogLevel;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ErrorHandler;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\PlainTextRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Log\\Logger;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Log\\StreamTarget;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\Runner\\FrankenPHP\\FrankenPHPApplicationRunner;\n"
"\n"
"$root = __DIR__;\n"
"\n"
"require_once $root . '/src/bootstrap.php';\n"
"\n"
"if (Environment::appC3()) {\n"
"    $c3 = $root . '/c3.php';\n"
"    if (file_exists($c3)) {\n"
"        require_once $c3;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"$runner = new FrankenPHPApplicationRunner(\n"
"    rootPath: $root,\n"
"    debug: Environment::appDebug(),\n"
"    checkEvents: Environment::appDebug(),\n"
"    environment: Environment::appEnv(),\n"
"    temporaryErrorHandler: new ErrorHandler(\n"
"        new Logger(\n"
"            [\n"
"                (new StreamTarget())->setLevels([\n"
"                    LogLevel::EMERGENCY,\n"
"                    LogLevel::ERROR,\n"
"                    LogLevel::WARNING,\n"
"                ]),\n"
"            ],\n"
"        ),\n"
"        new PlainTextRenderer(),\n"
"    ),\n"
");\n"
"$runner->run();\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Environment;\n"
"use Psr\\Log\\LogLevel;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\ErrorHandler;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\ErrorHandler\\Renderer\\PlainTextRenderer;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Log\\Logger;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Log\\StreamTarget;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\Runner\\FrankenPHP\\FrankenPHPApplicationRunner;\n"
"\n"
"$root = __DIR__;\n"
"\n"
"require_once $root . '/src/bootstrap.php';\n"
"\n"
"if (Environment::appC3()) {\n"
"    $c3 = $root . '/c3.php';\n"
"    if (file_exists($c3)) {\n"
"        require_once $c3;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"$runner = new FrankenPHPApplicationRunner(\n"
"    rootPath: $root,\n"
"    debug: Environment::appDebug(),\n"
"    checkEvents: Environment::appDebug(),\n"
"    environment: Environment::appEnv(),\n"
"    temporaryErrorHandler: new ErrorHandler(\n"
"        new Logger(\n"
"            [\n"
"                (new StreamTarget())->setLevels([\n"
"                    LogLevel::EMERGENCY,\n"
"                    LogLevel::ERROR,\n"
"                    LogLevel::WARNING,\n"
"                ]),\n"
"            ],\n"
"        ),\n"
"        new PlainTextRenderer(),\n"
"    ),\n"
");\n"
"$runner->run();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "The runner bootstraps the application once and then keeps processing requests in worker mode. Unlike classic `public/index.php`, this script is not executed per request."
msgstr "O runner faz o bootstrap da aplicação uma vez e depois continua processando requisições em modo worker. Diferente do `public/index.php` clássico, este script não é executado a cada requisição."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-rapira.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do servidor"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "FrankenPHP is configured through a `Caddyfile`. For production, it may look like the following:"
msgstr "O FrankenPHP é configurado por um `Caddyfile`. Em produção, ele pode ficar assim:"

#. type: Fenced code block (caddyfile)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    skip_install_trust\n"
"\n"
"    frankenphp {\n"
"\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"{$SERVER_NAME::80} {\n"
"    encode zstd br gzip\n"
"    php_server {\n"
"        root /app/public\n"
"        worker {\n"
"            match *\n"
"            file /app/worker.php\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    skip_install_trust\n"
"\n"
"    frankenphp {\n"
"\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"{$SERVER_NAME::80} {\n"
"    encode zstd br gzip\n"
"    php_server {\n"
"        root /app/public\n"
"        worker {\n"
"            match *\n"
"            file /app/worker.php\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "This configuration tells FrankenPHP to serve the `public` directory and handle all requests with `worker.php`.  Static assets are still served from `public`, while PHP requests are processed through the long-running worker."
msgstr "Essa configuração diz ao FrankenPHP para servir o diretório `public` e atender todas as requisições com o `worker.php`.  Os assets estáticos continuam sendo servidos de `public`, enquanto as requisições PHP são processadas pelo worker de longa duração."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "For development, add `watch` so FrankenPHP reloads workers when PHP files change:"
msgstr "Em desenvolvimento, adicione `watch` para que o FrankenPHP recarregue os workers quando arquivos PHP mudarem:"

#. type: Fenced code block (caddyfile)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    skip_install_trust\n"
"\n"
"    frankenphp {\n"
"\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"{$SERVER_NAME::80} {\n"
"    encode zstd br gzip\n"
"    php_server {\n"
"        root /app/public\n"
"        worker {\n"
"            match *\n"
"            file /app/worker.php\n"
"            watch /app/**/*.php\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    skip_install_trust\n"
"\n"
"    frankenphp {\n"
"\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"{$SERVER_NAME::80} {\n"
"    encode zstd br gzip\n"
"    php_server {\n"
"        root /app/public\n"
"        worker {\n"
"            match *\n"
"            file /app/worker.php\n"
"            watch /app/**/*.php\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Docker setup in Yii application templates"
msgstr "Configuração Docker nos templates de aplicação do Yii"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "Yii application templates already ship with a FrankenPHP-based Docker setup. To switch the application to worker mode, update the files inside the Docker layout instead of relying on `public/index.php`."
msgstr "Os templates de aplicação do Yii já vêm com uma configuração Docker baseada no FrankenPHP. Para passar a aplicação para o modo worker, altere os arquivos da estrutura Docker em vez de depender do `public/index.php`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "Create `/worker.php` in the project root as shown above, then update the Caddy configuration used by the container.  For development, edit `docker/dev/Caddyfile`:"
msgstr "Crie `/worker.php` na raiz do projeto como mostrado acima e depois altere a configuração do Caddy usada pelo container.  Em desenvolvimento, edite `docker/dev/Caddyfile`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "For production, use the same configuration without `watch` in `docker/Caddyfile`:"
msgstr "Em produção, use a mesma configuração sem `watch` em `docker/Caddyfile`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "The templates use `dunglas/frankenphp` as the base image in `docker/Dockerfile`, mount the project into `/app` in development, and pass runtime configuration through environment files such as `docker/dev/.env` and `docker/prod/.env`. The default value of `SERVER_NAME` in these files is `:80`, which matches the examples above."
msgstr "Os templates usam `dunglas/frankenphp` como imagem base em `docker/Dockerfile`, montam o projeto em `/app` no desenvolvimento e passam a configuração de runtime por arquivos de ambiente como `docker/dev/.env` e `docker/prod/.env`. O valor padrão de `SERVER_NAME` nesses arquivos é `:80`, que corresponde aos exemplos acima."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "After changing `worker.php` and the relevant `Caddyfile`, rebuild the image and restart the environment:"
msgstr "Depois de alterar o `worker.php` e o `Caddyfile` correspondente, reconstrua a imagem e reinicie o ambiente:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"make build\n"
"make up\n"
msgstr ""
"make build\n"
"make up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "In production, rebuild and deploy the production image using the project's production Docker workflow."
msgstr "Em produção, reconstrua a imagem de produção e faça o deploy usando o fluxo Docker de produção do projeto."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "If you switch fully to worker mode, `public/index.php` and `yiisoft/yii-runner-http` are no longer needed."
msgstr "Se você passar totalmente para o modo worker, o `public/index.php` e o `yiisoft/yii-runner-http` deixam de ser necessários."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-rapira.md ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-swoole.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting a server"
msgstr "Iniciando o servidor"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "The exact start command depends on how you run FrankenPHP:"
msgstr "O comando exato para iniciar depende de como você roda o FrankenPHP:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "In the Yii application templates, run `make build` and `make up` after updating `worker.php` and the relevant `Caddyfile`."
msgstr "Nos templates de aplicação do Yii, execute `make build` e `make up` depois de alterar o `worker.php` e o `Caddyfile` correspondente."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "With the standalone binary, run the following command from the directory containing your `Caddyfile`:"
msgstr "Com o binário standalone, execute o seguinte comando no diretório que contém o seu `Caddyfile`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "frankenphp run --config Caddyfile\n"
msgstr "frankenphp run --config Caddyfile\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "The example configuration uses `/app` as the application root. Adjust `/app/public`, `/app/worker.php`, and the watch path to match your installation. See the [FrankenPHP configuration reference](https://frankenphp.dev/docs/config/)  for other deployment options."
msgstr "A configuração de exemplo usa `/app` como raiz da aplicação. Ajuste `/app/public`, `/app/worker.php` e o caminho do watch conforme a sua instalação. Veja a [referência de configuração do FrankenPHP](https://frankenphp.dev/docs/config/)  para outras opções de deploy."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-rapira.md ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-roadrunner.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On worker scope"
msgstr "Sobre o escopo do worker"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "Each worker's memory is isolated from other workers."
msgstr "A memória de cada worker é isolada da dos outros workers."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "A single worker handles multiple requests, so services created inside it may keep state between requests."
msgstr "Um único worker atende várias requisições, então os serviços criados dentro dele podem manter estado entre requisições."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "At each iteration of the event loop, every stateful service should be reset."
msgstr "A cada iteração do event loop, todo serviço com estado deve ser redefinido."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "For the general implications of long-running workers, see [Using Yii with event loop](using-with-event-loop.md)."
msgstr "Para as implicações gerais de workers de longa duração, veja [Usando o Yii com event loop](using-with-event-loop.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Worker mode notes"
msgstr "Notas sobre o modo worker"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "Use the `MAX_REQUESTS` environment variable to limit how many requests a worker handles before restart."
msgstr "Use a variável de ambiente `MAX_REQUESTS` para limitar quantas requisições um worker atende antes de ser reiniciado."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "The runner calls `Yiisoft\\Di\\StateResetter::reset()` after each request. Register resetters for your stateful services as described in the [Yii DI documentation](https://github.com/yiisoft/di#resetting-services-state)."
msgstr "O runner chama `Yiisoft\\Di\\StateResetter::reset()` depois de cada requisição. Registre resetters para os seus serviços com estado, como descrito na [documentação do Yii DI](https://github.com/yiisoft/di#resetting-services-state)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-rapira.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional configuration"
msgstr "Configuração adicional"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "`FrankenPHPApplicationRunner` is configured by default for Yii application templates and follows the [dependency container configuration](../concept/configuration.md#container-configuration) concept."
msgstr "O `FrankenPHPApplicationRunner` vem configurado por padrão para os templates de aplicação do Yii e segue o conceito de [configuração do container de dependências](../concept/configuration.md#configuracao-do-container)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/tutorial/using-yii-with-frankenphp.md
msgid "The constructor allows overriding the default bootstrap, events, DI, params, and error-handler configuration.  You can also provide a custom config instance with `withConfig()` and a custom container with `withContainer()`."
msgstr "O construtor permite sobrescrever a configuração padrão de bootstrap, eventos, DI, params e tratamento de erros.  Você também pode fornecer uma instância de configuração personalizada com `withConfig()` e um container personalizado com `withContainer()`."
